---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';


const base = (import.meta.env.BASE_URL ?? '/').replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<BaseLayout title="Policy Impact Simulator" description="Describe a proposed law or regulation. Get a structured 1st → 2nd → 3rd order effect tree with direction, magnitude and confidence per node, plus demographic and stakeholder maps.">
<section class="hero">
  <span class="hero-badge">1st → 2nd → 3rd order effects</span>
  <h1 class="display-1">Trace a policy past its<br/><span class="grad-text">first-order effects.</span></h1>
  <p class="lead">Describe a proposed law or regulation. Get a structured 1st → 2nd → 3rd order effect tree with direction, magnitude and confidence per node — plus a demographic impact matrix, a stakeholder map, historical analogies, and side-by-side comparison.</p>
  <div class="hero-ctas">
<a href={`${base}/submit`} class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Simulate a policy</a>
<a href={`${base}/compare`} class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">Compare two policies</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-meta">
<span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 21h18M4 10h16M12 3 3 8h18l-9-5zM6 10v8M10 10v8M14 10v8M18 10v8"/></svg>Historical analogies included</span>
<span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v18M5 21h14M12 6 5 8l-2.5 6a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 5 0L5 8M12 6l7 2 2.5 6a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-5 0L19 8"/></svg>Stakeholder benefit / harm map</span>
<span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15v3M12 10v8M17 6v12"/></svg>Demographic impact matrix</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="grid-3">
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="6" cy="4" r="2.5"/><circle cx="6" cy="20" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="12" r="2.5"/><path d="M6 6.5v11M8.5 5.8c4 1 5.7 3.4 7 5.9"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Effect tree</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Direct, response and emergent effects — each node carries direction, magnitude and confidence.</p>
</article>
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Demographic matrix</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">How each group is affected, at a glance, across the full effect tree.</p>
</article>
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3v18M5 21h14M12 6 5 8l-2.5 6a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 5 0L5 8M12 6l7 2 2.5 6a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-5 0L19 8"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Stakeholder map</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Who benefits, who is harmed — mapped, not hand-waved.</p>
</article>
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20V2H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 4.5v15zM4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 6.5 22H20v-5"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Historical analogies</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Similar past policies and what actually happened after them.</p>
</article>
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 3v18M16 3v18M3 8h5M3 16h5M16 12h5M12 5l4 3-4 3"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Side-by-side</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Put two proposals next to each other and compare their projected effects.</p>
</article>
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Run history</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Every simulated policy is saved and re-openable.</p>
</article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section reveal">
  <div class="section-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Showcase</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Why indirect effects matter</h2>
    <p class="lead">First-order effects are the direct, intended consequences. What follows is where policy lives.</p>
  </div>

<div class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3" style="max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto">
  <div class="card card-hover p-5">
    <p class="eyebrow">1st order — direct</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">The rule changes an incentive, price, or requirement.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card card-hover p-5">
    <p class="eyebrow">2nd order — response</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Affected groups adjust behaviour in response.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card card-hover p-5" style="border-color: var(--accent)">
    <p class="eyebrow">3rd order — emergent</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">System-level pattern that follows from responses.</p>
  </div>
</div>

</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Three steps, no fluff</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-3">
<div class="step reveal">
  <div class="step-num">01</div>
  <h3 class="mt-2 text-[1rem] font-semibold">Submit policy text</h3>
  <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">With jurisdiction and domain for context.</p>
</div>
<div class="step reveal">
  <div class="step-num">02</div>
  <h3 class="mt-2 text-[1rem] font-semibold">Read the impact</h3>
  <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Effect tree, demographic grid, stakeholder map and analogies.</p>
</div>
<div class="step reveal">
  <div class="step-num">03</div>
  <h3 class="mt-2 text-[1rem] font-semibold">Compare & revisit</h3>
  <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Weigh two proposals side by side; reopen past runs in History.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section reveal">
  <div class="note-band">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
    <p>All projections are speculative modelling with stated confidence — illustrative structure, not forecasts.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="cta-band reveal">
    <h2 class="section-title">What does your policy set in motion?</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin: 0.8rem auto 1.8rem">Map the direct effects, the responses, and what emerges.</p>
    <a href={`${base}/submit`} class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Simulate a policy</a>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
